60
00:07:17,399 --> 00:07:19,384
<font color=#FFFF00>E ele nem percebe.</font>

61
00:07:43,323 --> 00:07:44,920
<font color=#FFFF00>Passe isso novamente.</font>

62
00:07:51,441 --> 00:07:52,908
